(text "INPUT / BUCK: nominal 12 V or 24 V on the SAME connector; regulated 9-30 V envelope.\nF1 and D100 protect wiring/polarity; no surge or mains-input rating is claimed." (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "55ca4f8f-c970-5d13-8f39-2dd8e173277f"))
(text "BUCK5 = 0.6*(1+101/13.5) = 5.08889 V nominal; both resistors 0.1%.\n500 kHz forced PWM. Keep VIN/GND capacitors at U10; compact SW area.\nCalculated DC range 4.999-5.179 V before trace/ripple; verify supply margin under load.\n2x22 uF output and 10 uH are based on TI's 5 V reference design." (at 198.12 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "401eff06-2aa3-56ff-93ed-39abc2182769"))
(text "ISOLATED RAW RAILS / LOCAL REGULATION ON NEXT SHEET" (at 20.32 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bcf519aa-5d24-5255-82e2-a60eb19e3c37"))
(text "R05P09D/P: +/-9 V, 55 mA per rail. 1.30k preloads maintain >=10% load.\nBasic 250 VAC rms working isolation; 6.4 kV DC is a 1-second TEST, not a working rating.\n4-10 pF isolation capacitance; neither filtering nor an ERC pass proves pA noise." (at 20.32 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5faf16ad-f2e1-5f61-9dd9-5d42ffd33c48"))
